#: scenario4:scenario4_15CB16D0_E549_433B_9F2B_A0AE54A1DD91
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 22f1896ed35e4e372e37fab8fe7c352427d2b351562a1aaba5067dd39f1e4302
