msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫......e⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫......got it?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫.........ill⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫......im⟪k:8⟫"
"⟪k:9⟫............good..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫......e⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫......entendeu?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫.........ou⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫......le⟪k:8⟫"
"⟪k:9⟫............bom..."

#: scenario4:scenario4_6EB564AD_94E5_468B_B345_ED2F871A2E39
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 28e5213f651aee1ee9d81ad823518e373c8d9e04ff4b2297b5fa4356e1684c4e
#. default-sha256: af67731a4277899df3bf117301eee29c1e1b92dc7cd98ee4ca83e0e1a2609e13
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_6EB564AD_94E5_468B_B345_ED2F871A2E39"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He was having trouble making out what they were saying, but he could tell it was several "
"men, and they were outside the front door."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ele estava tendo problemas para entender o que eles estavam dizendo, mas ele podia dizer que "
"eram vários homens, e estavam do lado de fora da porta da frente."

#: scenario4:scenario4_7EC4247B_E5E4_4739_B6F7_7877CE948467
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d4ebd3c65a367bcee282389f067d652b152acbaadfb7f7a4ae367547d2ca1aec
#. default-sha256: 839ab98589fcbca441338f896203c2edcee904506285a09e7862c566d8913abd
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_7EC4247B_E5E4_4739_B6F7_7877CE948467"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The fact that he could hear them at all through the heavy door meant they were probably "
"shouting quite loudly."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫O fato de ele poder ouvi-los através da porta pesada significava que provavelmente estavam "
"gritando bem alto."

#: scenario4:scenario4_15A7E258_72FE_465C_88F0_C2CB7DEE21F5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f3f2f1fff0c89b4aa57c6a950aaae1b4e27510f534fd7279dbc41dc0df26d1bf
