msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_15A7E258_72FE_465C_88F0_C2CB7DEE21F5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫............"

#: scenario4:scenario4_5CEEA977_CD91_4C02_B668_368F8D0B8781
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9d8556fc7fac197ff90bcacc0cfc651c1b982bbe373d1a3de44db3c6a8052ec8
#. default-sha256: 0167d2d6092646eee8729eb147eed72876a517f6e5ee407f71894c83a4706ded
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_5CEEA977_CD91_4C02_B668_368F8D0B8781"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫An indescribable sense of uneasiness came over him. ⟪k:1⟫Dread. ⟪k:2⟫He drew nearer to the "
"door and focused on the voices on the other side."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Uma sensação indescritível de inquietação tomou conta dele. ⟪k:1⟫Horror. ⟪k:2⟫Ele se "
"aproximou da porta e concentrou-se nas vozes do outro lado."

#: scenario4:scenario4_94A37FCB_0D02_4E7F_831E_711A98040308
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9dbbea161dceb1ebc7a7f4f05c2cba9bbe4265d3684fccf4d5a558670b1202a5
#. default-sha256: 5c9621ec2c3f3c7c5f3a6d8f9ba68d30699afab5e041e7c1dda66a86bcaec2c2
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_94A37FCB_0D02_4E7F_831E_711A98040308"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫They grew clearer—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫enough for him to make out what the men were saying."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Elas ficaram mais claras—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫o suficiente para ele entender o que os homens estavam "
"dizendo."

#: scenario4:scenario4_DE196966_60D1_4F84_A73A_06CABADD72E2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e45f707c00895d1f3f1f764778b58fd89e4b257b73b20d94bcb342665617a184
#. default-sha256: 8bb551eeb1850f2c8da37c1c5ce7601d9a98fc12b36432c8029e873881ca15a2
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_DE196966_60D1_4F84_A73A_06CABADD72E2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Everything’s in place.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫We’re ready to kill this witch now."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Tudo está no lugar.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Estamos prontos para matar essa bruxa agora."

#: scenario4:scenario4_020BB8B6_BA4E_4354_A1E9_8CEC4E825D30
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 94b01be076beaa01448258e8e9c85cd191767b96b2f59d8fabee5424107328c3
#. default-sha256: caa0a01bc2398185679b11bd20476dee4b774ca95b731420cf4d4d0a5d90bd3a
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_020BB8B6_BA4E_4354_A1E9_8CEC4E825D30"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫This is definitely the place.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫That half-dead bandit said she was in this mansion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Este definitivamente é o lugar.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Aquele bandido meio morto disse que ela estava "
"nesta mansão."

#: scenario4:scenario4_F5E94AA9_A9AA_4E9A_A20B_D8B3B8954BB6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ea01412311a30e97a5963d97f8c95aa397d8ba30d5ec43b18170999b5ca8ba69
#. default-sha256: ccc6c16c0c0e22abe3b1b6603c7968c2d6b9fb3b88796212cdbc36c5e5178723
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_F5E94AA9_A9AA_4E9A_A20B_D8B3B8954BB6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Listen well. No matter what we find in there, we kill it.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It could be a child for "
"all I care—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫that doesn’t change anything."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Escutem bem. Não importa o que encontremos lá, nós matamos.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Poderia ser uma criança "
"até onde sei—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫isso não muda nada."

#: scenario4:scenario4_D8BD9768_36BB_40C7_BE0E_01A88DBA775F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1c62baebe7a39213e393b2f302d95ef0267dff4eb85a50df7062de88769b5f15
#. default-sha256: 044440555f2b6b8f996896414582997ac189777f0bc875b52646b0e73add3058
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_D8BD9768_36BB_40C7_BE0E_01A88DBA775F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Kill the witch..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Matem a bruxa..."

#: scenario4:scenario4_E6DBC15F_E0F2_4941_B4B3_FB7674C65739
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e445dd3548b23176287be8ab4ddbf19f07b49a8aa067778dd8b4d4b7507586d5
#. default-sha256: 23cd9cfc9593c68f7830e08a1091196190ac89de3e309d7dcb9ccd8f87e8f556
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_E6DBC15F_E0F2_4941_B4B3_FB7674C65739"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Kill the witch! Kill the witch! Kill the witch!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Matem a bruxa! Matem a bruxa! Matem a bruxa!"

#: scenario4:scenario4_2CB8A8EE_8568_44A3_ADA7_4EB7FB5ED8F5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f9d43e6f8e37436b9e21f5883b8ed7321fabc4621ac03395e077f4781eefe3dc
#. default-sha256: f0f04c711f011a8a9874adb15a2c6bd6b568ea1a0eb6f41a83310b961977028e
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_2CB8A8EE_8568_44A3_ADA7_4EB7FB5ED8F5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫—!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫—!"

#: scenario4:scenario4_6E7CDC7B_C369_47C1_BA22_A4E17465AAA1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ec1e703017e3787ffe4862fb83b5bd15420734e67864bcb32c14728cea4ced4d
#. default-sha256: 78ea7bc8f945d584f5f1b342c56b21ecdcbfa99e0cbd03952b3521c0c3dd3b14
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_6E7CDC7B_C369_47C1_BA22_A4E17465AAA1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫What he heard beyond the door was a group of men shouting for the death of the witch."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫O que ele ouviu do outro lado da porta foi um grupo de homens gritando pela morte da bruxa."

#: scenario4:scenario4_A690B82C_4F7D_4B0F_9AD2_462D3342E8CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ff50edc02c2c013de3f5998080e38b9eb14412156b706e0e753370d7a8a80186
#. default-sha256: 8cf91108d86e8e1589440e28b409898a477105a448a711e85a6ac7b305b46b5e
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_A690B82C_4F7D_4B0F_9AD2_462D3342E8CD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫In that moment, Michel regretted his decision to let the bandit go free and not watch over "
"him until the moment of his demise."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Naquele momento, Michel lamentou sua decisão de liberar o bandido e não vigiar até o momento "
"de sua morte."

#: scenario4:scenario4_3245971D_8FCA_4EC9_8C19_3F353B987522
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b8d60deacee2c499b8bdc1d13147a3093677095f4c45c5d1be7e442b60304c0a
#. default-sha256: af845cb85e24bbaba6b7fb19bf4f613e538bc2668f1893789a2b04a41e61a501
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_3245971D_8FCA_4EC9_8C19_3F353B987522"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He must have made his way down to the village in search of help, where he revealed what he "
"had found at the mansion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ele deve ter descido até a aldeia em busca de ajuda, onde revelou o que havia encontrado na "
"mansão."

#: scenario4:scenario4_F047AE0F_CCB8_4BDB_AC49_0FD8AD283747
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 688ef158d43d65418e034cd6eb458aaab9f6e10c04652e55e8a6cb7b301d1803
#. default-sha256: bd9ed91979a1b80c5f78e9af700ebbf3edd683497b7a3abf0dbad3480c1772b9
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_F047AE0F_CCB8_4BDB_AC49_0FD8AD283747"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Dammit!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Droga!"

#: scenario4:scenario4_54F65A8D_97D4_464B_8D56_5B38582F256D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 71cc91488a1c3b586f0f4a1f4db82ae7dc561cfa0197c8cc4fe58585a4313c0c
#. default-sha256: d78970e6c63a01c25ce51f211de32800a853dba431b784026baf9a10cbc292f0
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_54F65A8D_97D4_464B_8D56_5B38582F256D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But it was too late.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Regret would solve nothing."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Mas era tarde demais.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Arrependimento não resolveria nada."

#: scenario4:scenario4_51142D17_A574_4A28_9DD0_1458CF035845
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c1edf05a4d3cef406922516a16ed2b53a150971152ce2431cd33b5aaeb9c6fd3
#. default-sha256: 09946d3467ba7502519cce6eb657c7e3b51e6229019e01d964f7a0ad00d71ece
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_51142D17_A574_4A28_9DD0_1458CF035845"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He could neither stop the villagers from raiding the house, nor could he stop the White-"
"Haired Girl from dying to the effects of his curse."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ele não podia impedir os aldeões de invadir a casa, nem podia impedir a Garota de Cabelos "
"Brancos de morrer pelos efeitos de sua maldição."

#: scenario4:scenario4_181FDD0D_E253_466B_A870_811424899C19
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c5e5f4770d6e23b20468b0ec8817b81c9631d6f8baa2d156a76186020d919ad0
#. default-sha256: 71e387c2a503123a6e7561732cb5a9806757bc4ca3d35967f4c46565a0049f66
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_181FDD0D_E253_466B_A870_811424899C19"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He was helpless to do anything. ⟪k:1⟫The gears of his fate had locked him onto a path of "
"tragedy and were turning mercilessly onward."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ele estava impotente para fazer qualquer coisa. ⟪k:1⟫As engrenagens de seu destino o "
